  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">너와 나는 - 이해인</span><br><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">돌아도 끝없는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">둥근 세상</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">너와 나는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">밤낮을 같이하는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">두 개의 시계바늘</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">네가 길면</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">나는 짧고</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">네가 짧으면</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">나는 길고</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">사랑으로 못 박히면</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">돌이킬 수 없네</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">서로를 받쳐 주는 원 안에</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">빛을 향해 눈뜨는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">숙명의 반려</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">한순간도</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">쉴 틈이 없는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">너와 나는</span><br><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">영원을 똑딱이는</span><br><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-ke-size=\"size16\">두 개의 시계바늘</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
